# Runtime data written by the running server (accounts, friends, bans,
# reports, replays, achievements, transactions, ratings, feedback, admin
# log, play history) - never meant to be in version control. Written with
# relative paths, so these can appear at the repo root, or inside
# VertexClient/ or VertexServer/ depending on where the jar/process is run
# from - ignored everywhere via **/.
**/gamehub_*.dat
**/gamehub_*.txt

# Compiled output, if ever built into the tree instead of a scratch dir.
**/*.class
build/
out/

# OS/editor cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
